        "kind" : "plus#comment",
        "object" : {
          "content" : "<span class=\"proflinkWrapper\"><span class=\"proflinkPrefix\">+</span><a class=\"proflink\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/109435216621223486088\" oid=\"109435216621223486088\">Bret Stateham</a></span><br /> Is it possible to connect the Galileo to a monitor and actually have a Desktop mode of windows running? Would it be possible to do something like install a program on the Galileo and run it, for example could I install spotify while it&#39;s running windows on the Galileo?",
